    {
      "source": "A Servlet <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/Filter.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\"><code>Filter</code></a> that provides an <a href=\"../../error/ErrorPageRegistry.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.web.error\"><code>ErrorPageRegistry</code></a> for non-embedded\napplications (i.e. deployed WAR files). It registers error pages and handles\napplication errors by filtering requests and forwarding to the error pages instead of\nletting the server handle them. Error pages are a feature of the servlet spec but there\nis no Java API for registering them in the spec. This filter works around that by\naccepting error page registrations from Spring Boot's <a href=\"../../error/ErrorPageRegistrar.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.web.error\"><code>ErrorPageRegistrar</code></a> (any\nbeans of that type in the context will be applied to this server).",
      "translation": "一个 Servlet <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/Filter.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\"><code>Filter</code></a>，为非嵌入式应用程序（即部署的 WAR 文件）提供 <a href=\"../../error/ErrorPageRegistry.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.web.error\"><code>ErrorPageRegistry</code></a>。它通过过滤请求并将它们转发到错误页面来处理应用程序错误，而不是让服务器处理这些错误。错误页面是 Servlet 规范的一项功能，但该规范中并没有用于注册它们的 Java API。此过滤器通过接受来自 Spring Boot 的 <a href=\"../../error/ErrorPageRegistrar.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.web.error\"><code>ErrorPageRegistrar</code></a> 的错误页面注册来解决这一问题（上下文中的任何此类 Bean 都将应用于此服务器）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
